  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IN COUNTRY MICRO PROJECTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the construction of multi-purpose evacuation centre for the period April to July 2023. This project aims to build an evacuation centre that will provide critical safety and protection for the community in the region in times of disaster (particularly tropical cyclones, which we have seen in recent months is a living reality for the Vanuatu population). This centre will also provide a multi functional space for the community to utilise outside of cyclone season.</narrative>
  </description>
